  (text "PNM-PWR Rev A notes"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 160 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "ceb881cf-cab6-5c01-ac96-9ab358261d35")
  )
  (text "1. BQ24074 OUT (VSYS) regulates to 4.4 V > EG800Q VBAT max 4.3 V, so the modem is on VBAT (battery node), per Quectel practice."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 164.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "0b5c58bb-3700-5cd8-b080-55c59bf6e13c")
  )
  (text "   Modem load on VBAT can prevent charge termination while USB is present: firmware keeps the modem in DRX/sleep when charging."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 169 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "7ba89a28-b205-5bb8-ac2d-0619efb0b313")
  )
  (text "2. U4 routes the SoC USB to USB-C (USB_SEL=0, default: flashing/ADB) or to the modem (USB_SEL=1). R13 asserts modem USB_VBUS with SEL."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 173.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "55f5c3ea-4d25-5179-8ce6-db700a563735")
  )
  (text "3. U6 VCCB = +3V3_SOC so the modem-UART translator is fully off when the SoC is unpowered."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 178 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "6aac7a5f-3eba-5210-a2aa-adaa50bc06ba")
  )
  (text "4. RF pi-match R14/C13/C14 must be tuned on the final antenna; U.FL J3 is the bench antenna feed."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 182.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "7959708a-56ca-5eeb-8d13-928abae95bb5")
  )
